"**Description**: Query the USGS FDSN earthquake database with custom "
"parameters to search historical and recent seismic events. Filter by "
"magnitude, time range, location (bounding box or radial search), and "
"depth. Returns detailed GeoJSON for all matching earthquakes. Useful for "
"historical seismicity analysis, regional earthquake studies, and risk "
"assessment."
